            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided an information page 10 of a security document 1, comprising a core layer 11 having flexibility for incorporating the information page into the security document; an IC module holding layer 12 provided on one surface of the core layer 11 via an intermediate layer 13; an additional intermediate layer 14 provided on one surface of the ID module holding layer 12, and an IC module 20 held in the IC module holding layer 12 and including a substrate 21, and an IC chip 22a provided on the substrate 21, wherein the intermediate layer 13, the IC module holding layer 12 and the additional intermediate layer 14 are made of polycarbonate, and wherein the information page further comprises a transparent window 36 made of a transparent material and penetrating at least the core layer 11, the intermediate layer 13, the IC module holding layer 12 and the additional intermediate layer 14.</p>
            </abstract>
